                    {
                        "description": "Tap left Cmd alone -> F19. Lives in Karabiner, not Hammerspoon, because Hammerspoon never sees the Tab in Cmd+Tab (AltTab/app switcher eat it) but does see Karabiner's fake Cmd release from the Tabby Esc-prefix rule. Hammerspoon binds F19 and vetoes it if the mouse was used while Cmd was held, which Karabiner can't see (no trackpad access).",
                        "manipulators": [
